1
00:00:04,567 --> 00:00:08,934
One command. A real desktop app.

2
00:00:09,201 --> 00:00:11,035
Sign in with GitHub.

3
00:00:11,085 --> 00:00:14,389
Connect your Claude.

4
00:00:14,439 --> 00:00:18,091
Pick your repos.

5
00:00:18,691 --> 00:00:21,849
Review requests land in your queue.

6
00:00:22,449 --> 00:00:34,145
Claude drafts the review
from the real diff.

7
00:00:34,412 --> 00:00:40,337
You pick what's worth saying.

8
00:00:40,387 --> 00:00:42,688
Posted under your name.
Nothing posts until you click.

9
00:00:43,188 --> 00:00:47,160
Scan once.
Your phone is signed in.

10
00:00:47,660 --> 00:00:51,730
Review from anywhere.

11
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:58,509
Swipe to keep.

12
00:00:59,009 --> 00:01:02,657
It learns what your team drops.
